      "message": "In this particular case, we have to also copy the SkString into the arena of the code dictionary, since SkUniform only holds const char*.\n\nI would imagine when we are converting the runtime uniforms to the SkUniforms, we first have a loop along the lines of:\n\n   std::vector\u003cconst char*\u003e savedNames;\n   for (auto u : runtimeEffect-\u003euniforms()) {\n       savedNames.push_back(codeDict-\u003earena.make(u.name()).c_str());\n   }\n   codeDict-\u003earena.makeInitializedArray(runtimeEffect-\u003euniforms().size(), [](int index) {\n      return SkUniform(runtimeEffect-\u003euniforms()[i].type, ..., savedNames[i]);\n   });",
